<title>USA: Sallie Mae prices floating rate note issue.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae prices floating rate note issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association said Monday it priced a $500 million issue of short-term floating rate notes at 19 basis points above the 91-day U.S. Treasury bill.</p>
<p>When-issued trading is expected to begin at 0820 hrs EST (1320 GMT) Tuesday, it said.</p>
<p>The notes are for settlement January 9. Maturity date is July 17, 1997. Cusip number is 86387TEY0.</p>
<p>The interest rate on the notes will be reset the day after each weekly bill auction.</p>
</text>
